  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* speed-up replicateZip - reduce CPU utilization and fix ZIP format errors by @jpstotz in https://github.com/majd/ipatool/pull/506\r\n* fix: handle sap guest timeouts by @majd in https://github.com/majd/ipatool/pull/528\r\n* fix(keychain): configure macOS credential access by @majd in https://github.com/majd/ipatool/pull/531\r\n* add list-purchases command for owned apps by @majd in https://github.com/majd/ipatool/pull/532\r\n* retry transient App Store authentication responses by @majd in https://github.com/majd/ipatool/pull/533\r\n* add visionOS search and download support by @majd in https://github.com/majd/ipatool/pull/534\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @jpstotz made their first contribution in https://github.com/majd/ipatool/pull/506\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/majd/ipatool/compare/v2.4.0...v2.5.0",
